# No AI co-authors

Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, AI agents, or `cursoragent@cursor.com`.

Never add "Made with Cursor" footers to commits or pull requests.

When creating or amending commits, use the message exactly as drafted — do not append attribution trailers. If a hook or environment injects one, remove it before finishing.
